# Web Page Development Process

Follow each step below carefully, and only proceed to the next step when the step is completed.

# Goal: Build a new page for the website that aligns with the brand identity.

## Process Steps
1. Discuss page structure and content.
   - A new md file for the page is created in the Page Docs directory. this file will be used as a source of truth for the page. this file also includes a check list so that we can track what is needed to complete the page.
2. Create a page skeleton using the page-sections.md file.
   - A new file is created in the /pages directory for the page.
3. Import each page section using the appropriate component. Reference the component name in the page-sections.md file.
   - The page has all of the imported components.
4. Proof read content to make sure it aligns with the brand identity. (check brand_red_rouge in memory)
   - Content is aligned with the brand identity.
5. Implement any additional functionality or styling as needed.
   - Any additional functionality or styling is implemented as needed.
6. Test the final page to ensure it works as intended.
   - The page works as intended.
7. Deploy the final page to the live website.
   - The page is deployed to the live website.

